# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR[[cite:obs-111cda114d86e917bdad8d00f13a1ff813ea0715 "The daily allowance for domestic travel is forty (40) EUR."]].

Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director[[cite:obs-9b90ebb76948e8f090425c21727c1cb07f4bb80a "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
